format session-log-v1
stamp 20260815.000323
editor Zed
model Fable 5
voice Kyri
host Ubuntu cloud pier — Eastern (EDT) time convention
title ALES101 — Lotus's run-length smoother, absorb spurious short runs (the VAD hysteresis the family named)
prompt recur the itinerary Lindy-first crux-first; after ALES100 sent, take the next agent-doable Lotus lap, self-approve, prove GREEN, send as its own signed round; STOP at custody gates
think ALES95's own scope note names its horizon plainly: a real voice-activity detector adds smoothing hysteresis this rung does not, those are later rungs. ALES94 said the same. This is that rung — the smoothing the whole silence family (ALES94 classifier, ALES95 segmenter, ALES96 stripper, ALES100 collapser) has waited on. Lindy: hold through a short excursion is as old as the noise gate's hold knob. Crux: it is the decisive robustness move that turns a per-frame reader into a usable segmenter — raw segmentation flickers, one loud tick reads as a one-frame voiced blip and splits a pause, one quiet frame a spurious silent gap; feed that to the stripper and it cuts a pause in two or spares a click as a word.
think Kept it a READ-ONLY transform over the LABELS, never the audio — a rewrite of one segment.Segments into a smoothed one, no PCM touched. That keeps the family a tower of readers (ALES95 read the clip into runs; ALES101 reads runs into cleaner runs). The rule: seed with the first run, then for each later run extend the open run (keeping its verdict) when the run is shorter than min_run OR shares the open run's verdict, else push it. The verdict-match branch matters — after absorbing a short run, its two long neighbours can become adjacent same-verdict and must re-coalesce in the same pass, else the coalesced law breaks.
think Proved it by four data laws on the output rather than by mirroring the loop, which is stronger. Coverage: the output tiles the same span exactly (same first start, same total length) — checked by a well_smoothed predicate that walks the output as data. Coalesced: no two adjacent runs share a verdict. Hold: every run past the first is at least min_run — the opener is the honest exception, a causal left-to-right hold having nothing before it to absorb into (a leading short blip survives, and I state that plainly as scope rather than hiding it). Idempotence: a second pass at the same min_run is a fixed point. Monotonicity: a larger min_run yields at most as many runs. Identity falls out — min_run=0, and any min_run below the shortest run, leave a coalesced input unchanged.
obs First witness run GREEN on the first pass — the crux grid runs three input shapes (flickering middle, alternating short chain, clean two-region) over nine min_run values, each asserting all three data laws; plus a spurious-blip case (silent 100 · voiced 2 · silent 100 → one silent 202), a surviving leading short run, idempotence over five mins, monotonicity over eight, the identity over four mins below the shortest run, a span-past coalesce to one, empty stays empty, single run unchanged, and a segmenter-grounded case (a 4-sample tick buried in a pause absorbed, the pause coalescing to one). TAME style bans clean, width-check exit 0.
obs No custody gate reached — software only, local, read-only over labels; no funds, keys, network, device, or real speaker. SmoothError.SegmentsFull kept named for the honest path though it cannot fire (out.len <= in.len <= max_segments), the same honesty ALES95 keeps about its own SegmentsFull.
loom witness=ales_smooth_runs_witness green=1 laws=4 crux_grid=27 min_run_values=9 module_bytes=15k
file lotus/smooth_runs.rye ALES101 — smooth_runs() seeds with the first run then extends-or-pushes, absorbing runs shorter than min_run into what surrounds them, read-only over segment.Segments.
file tools/ales_smooth_runs_witness.rish the witness — builds, runs the selftest, asserts the GREEN line.
file active-designing/20260815-000323_fill-ales101-lotus-run-length-smoother.md the self-approved design read naming the coverage, coalesced, hold, and idempotence+monotonicity laws.
file lotus/README.md front door — the ALES101 rung appended to the roster and the stamp synced.
recommend keep-going — the next Lotus crux stays in the VAD family: a symmetric (two-sided) smoother that also rescues a too-short opening run this causal hold cannot, an apply rung that runs smooth_runs before ALES96/ALES100 so the stripper never splits a pause on a tick, or a minimum-gap merge that only smooths .silent runs; each its own self-approved round, no custody gate reached.
